# === Large Binary Assets ===
# Tracked through Git LFS, not ignored: .gitattributes routes *.blend, *.fbx,
# *.png, *.exr, audio and fonts to LFS. Run `git lfs install` once per machine.

# === Art pipeline (Blender -> Unity) — regenerated outputs ===
*.blend1
*.blend2
blender/.current_*.py
blender/export/
renders/
unity/.run_*.cs
unity/reports/
# Unity captures never live in Assets/
/Assets/Captures/
/Assets/Captures.meta
*_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/
*.unitypackage
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]sset[Ss]tore[Tt]ools*

